+//!   hand without one (`"50F2EEE4/-"`: the main hand alone). One colour trails both, as before.
+//! - `PlayUnitAfterimage(unit, seconds[, alpha[, colour[, x, y, z[, standIn]]]])`: a see-through
+//!   copy of the unit's own body and what it holds, frozen in the pose it has now and lit as a ghost
+//!   of light, left where it stands for `seconds` (at most 10) and fading away (`alpha` 0.05 to 1
+//!   as it appears, 0.6 when absent; `colour` `"RRGGBB"` over it, its own when absent). Given a spot
